@startuml
title Order status: transitions allowed by the business

hide empty description

state PENDING
state CONFIRMED
state REJECTED #FFCDD2
state UNDER_REVIEW #FFF8E1
state SHIPPED #ECEFF1
state DELIVERED #ECEFF1
state CANCELING #ECEFF1
state CANCELED #ECEFF1

[*] --> PENDING : order placed
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : paid and\nstock secured
PENDING --> REJECTED : holds no payment:\nout of stock, payment refused,\ntimed out
PENDING --> UNDER_REVIEW : a refund keeps failing,\nor review delay reached
UNDER_REVIEW --> CONFIRMED : administrator,\nif paid and stock secured
UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : administrator,\nonce it holds no payment
CONFIRMED --> SHIPPED : administrator
SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : administrator
CONFIRMED --> CANCELING : customer cancels
CANCELING --> CANCELED : stock returned\nand payment refunded
CANCELING --> UNDER_REVIEW : the refund\nkeeps failing
UNDER_REVIEW --> CANCELED : administrator,\nonce refunded
REJECTED --> [*]
DELIVERED --> [*]
CANCELED --> [*]

legend right
  Gray: proposed, awaiting validation
endlegend
@enduml
